OL,3,GNEWSARiver of Light return confirmed
OL,4,Aafter storm disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool's River of Light festival
OL,7,Fwill get under way later after its
OL,8,Ffirst three days were cancelled due to
OL,9,Fhigh winds.
OL,11,FThe event featuring free public art
OL,12,Finstallations was due to begin on
OL,13,FFriday but was called off for safety
OL,14,Freasons.
OL,16,FArtworks located along Liverpool's
OL,17,Fwaterfront and in key locations across
OL,18,Fthe city centre will be illuminated
OL,19,Fbetween 17:00 and 21:00 GMT each day
OL,20,Funtil 1 November.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
