OL,3,GNEWSARiver of Light return confirmed
OL,4,Aafter storm disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,F"After a brief pause while the storms
OL,7,Fpassed through, River of Light will
OL,8,Flight up Liverpool City Centre tonight
OL,9,Ffrom 5pm-9pm!" said organisers.
